 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "I Became the Husband of the Cult Leader of the Demonic Sect."
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "마교 교주의 부군이 되었다"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "One of the Six Divine Clans of the Heavenly Demon Sect, the great heir of the Majin Jin Clan, Jin Yeomyeong.\nGrateful for being born with a golden spoon in my mouth, I just wanted to enjoy a sweet life...\nBut damn that Murim Alliance — they destroyed the Heavenly Demon Sect.\n\nAnd in the final moments of my life, the cult leader Cheon Yura says to me:\n“Would you seduce me?”"
  },
